Siinkohal on Island endapoolse

43
00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.050
panusena saatnud meile abiks
strateegilise

44
00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.000
kommunikatsioonispetsialisti Tori.

45
00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:46.090
Miks on see oluline,
et NATO on siin Eestis kohapeal

46
00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.465
ja toetab meid?

47
00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:54.730
One of the big challenge is that
Europe is facing now.

48
00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:59.590
You are geograafiline next to the
enemy, it's important that,

49
00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:04.750
that NATO has presence all around the
Eastern flank. If something happens,

50
00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:10.910
that you can react on day one,
because if you lose the first few

51
00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.990
