juhtimas tankirühma.

147
00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:02.120
Vahepeal saabunud kõrgetasemelise
väljakutse pärast jääb tema isik meie

148
00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:05.720
saates varjatuks,
aga praegu on tema asi oma mehed ühes

149
00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.845
tehnikaga vaenlase eest öisesse metsa
peita.

150
00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:19.260
So it's always a decision between all
don't sleep in order to be able to

151
00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:23.500
continue the fights and all the risk
we take when we sleep because we are

152
00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.925
not waken. Hello.

153
00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.310
Prantslased juba oskavad enda elu
mugavaks teha, masin,

154
00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:09.730
